Language English

// this is run during the Mythos phase while they
// are killing cultists

Book FeedGate Ordered No Keep
	Triggered By @ReadDvm If goal = goalFeedGate And ritual
	
	Page Init
		Text """
			Sarah looks at all of you and says, <<It is too late to stop Matthias
			from opening the gate. But he didn't have an elder sign, so he was
			not able to stabilize the gate. He needs a steady stream of the
			willing to sacrifice themselves to keep the gate open.>>
			
			As she speaks, a cultist somehow sqeezes through the hole to the cell,
			steps to the gate, pulls out a dagger, and slits his throat. When his
			blood hits the floor, it is pulled up by the gate, drop-by-drop.
		
			
			<<You must kill them,>> she says loudly. Everyone in the room turns
			to look at her. <<You must kill them all.>>
			
			When she spoke, Matthias noticed the intruders for the first time.
			A look of worry crosses his face, but only for a moment. He returns
			immediately to his summoning.			
		"""
	End Page
	
	Page Instructions
		
		Add TokenSarahAltar!
		
		Text """
			Sarah leans down and whispers to {c:EventChosenInvestigator}, <<You
			must kill Matthias, then close and seal the gate.>>
			
			Sarah turns to the others and says loudly, <<You must kill these
			cultists. It might be easier to head toward the chapel since that
			seems to be where they are coming from. Speak to me if you want to
			go out. If you want to come back, yell to me through the hole.>>
			
			Move Sarah to the board as indicated.
		"""
		
	End Page Instructions
	
	Page RitualBegins
		Text """
			You freeze as something... <i>happens</> to the house. You aren't
			sure what it is, but fear clutches your gut as the feeling washes
			over you.
			
			Then, from deep in the house, you hear a boy scream in pain and
			terror. He stops abruptly and you feel something in the air, like
			electricity. The house shudders and everything goes quiet. Sarah's
			eyes widen and she whispers to {c:EventChosenInvestigator}, <<He's
			started. The ritual has started. We have to get to the
			{c:TileAltar} and stop your cousin Matthias.>>
			
			As she finishes speaking, someone in cult robes runs by you,
			heading toward the cell.
		"""
	End Page RitualBegins

	Page GateOpens
		Text """
			The woman's screaming stops and, for a moment, the house is silent
			again... as if the house were taking a breath. Then, though you
			cannot see it, you can feel the gate spring into being. You
			hear... <i>something</> moan in pain, reverberating through the
			wall, an unearthly sound. You know in your gut it's Matthias's son.
			
			The feeling of power grows stronger; it radiates through the
			floorboards and moves through the walls. Sarah whispers, <<The
			gate is open, we have to stop him.>>
			
			As she speaks, another cultist brushes past you, also heading
			toward the cell.

			Sarah lights up. <<We have the {c:QItemElderSign}. Without it,
			Matthias needs constant sacrifice to keep the gate open. Those
			cultists are his sacrifices.

			<<You must kill them,>> she says loudly. Everyone in the room turns
			to look at her. <<You must kill them all.>>
		"""
		
		feedGateKillCount = 0
		feedGateKillGoal = 2 * #investigator + 2 + !exploredGateNicely * #investigator
		feedGateKillCount = 0
	End Page GateOpens
		
	Page Sacrifice
		Text """
			The house pulses with power, overwhelming you for a moment. You
			snap back to awareness as a cultist approaches. You steady yourself
			for another attack.
			
			The power you feel sputters with instability. With these cultists
			as sacrifice, the gate will remain open; without them, it will
			surely collapse.
		"""
	End Page Sacrifice
	
	Page Hurry
		Text """
			Sarah whispers, <<We must hurry. He is summoning his god. I can
			feel it.>>
			
			The house continues to vibrate with what you assume is the energy
			of the gate. What should be a stable hum continues its uneven
			popping.
		"""
	End Page Hurry
	
	Page Ponder
		Text """
			You stop for a moment and wonder, <i>How many cultists do we have
			to kill? We've already killed {feedGateKillCount}.</i> Out of
			the corner of your eye you see another one coming. It's time to get
			back to work.
		"""
	End Page Ponder
	
	Page KeepGoing 
		Text """
			The house stops vibrating for a moment. When it starts again, it
			is weaker, but still powerful.
			
			<<What you are doing is working,>> Sarah whispers. <<Keep going. I
			think we're close.>>
		"""
	End Page KeepGoing
	
	
	Loop Random
	
	Page RunningOutOfTime Random
		Text """
			<<Hurry,>> Sarah whispers. <<The gate is still open and we are
			running out of time.>>
		"""
	End Page RunningOutOfTime
	
	Page ItsComing Random
		Text """
			<<Please,>> Sarah begs, <<It is almost here.>>
		"""
	End Page ItsComing
	
	Page ItsHere Random
		Text """
			<<I can feel It. It is here. We may already be too late.>>
		"""
	End Page ItsHere
	
	Page SarahTransports
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @CompleteRequirement If goal = goalFeedGate And foundKnife And foundDvm And foundElderSign And foundDungeonCell And exploredCryptViaChapel And exploredDungeonCaveViaBasement
		
		Text """
			Sarah smiles for the first time and says out load, <<That's it! Now
			we know what is going on, where it's happening, and what to do about
			it. I think I can take us where we need to be.>>
			
			Sarah seems to grow, getting more transparent. Suddenly, the world
			shifts and you are... somewhere else. And disoriented. There is
			noise and light and someone yelling. Folks are rushing by. It all
			seems far away.>>
		"""
		
		If firstRitual < firstRitualWoman Call MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate.Woman
		If firstRitual < firstRitualOpenGate Call MythosFirstRitualFeedOrCloseGate.OpenGate
		
		firstRitual = false
		Trigger @ExploreAltar
		Goto Init
	End Page SarahTransports
End Book FeedGate